<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Manukyan et al. (2017) Nature hexagonal skin-scale border thickness reduction & outer-totalistic cellular automaton (Ocellated / jeweled lizard (Timon lepidus) dorsal skin scale labyrinth)",
        "Manukyan et al. (2017) Nature hexagonal skin-scale border thickness reduction & outer-totalistic cellular automaton faithfully reproduces Ocellated / jeweled lizard (Timon lepidus) dorsal skin scale labyrinth morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-1>,
