    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2015-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Ocellated / jeweled lizard (Timon lepidus) dorsal skin scale labyrinth specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 46.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-ocellated-lizard-ca-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2015-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca.py> ;
    schema:about "Ocellated / jeweled lizard (Timon lepidus) dorsal skin scale labyrinth" ;
