<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Manukyan et al. (2017) Nature hexagonal skin-scale border thickness reduction & outer-totalistic cellular automaton — MorphoEval overall 46.7/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2015-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca.py` (overall weighted score: 48.8 / 100). The v1 script implements the discrete 2D hexagonal outer-totalistic cellular automaton transition probabilities from Manukyan et al. (2017), but omits the underlying continuous Kondo-Asai reaction-diffusion PDE on a hexagonal skin-scale domain with inter-scale border thickness reduction D_border = P * D_interior (the central physical mechanism of the Nature paper showing how PDEs discretize into a scale-level CA); lacks negative controls (P = 0.0 insulated scales, P = 1.0 smooth continuum skin without scale borders, and equal-diffusion d = 1.0); never loads or segments the vendored Timon lepidus dorsal scale photograph; and exposes only 2 scalar measurements without CLI parameter flags. Overall 46.7/100 (faithfulness 39.6, reproducibility 63.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 50, Morphological realism / specimen match 28, Parameter expressivity 44, Morphometric validation 42, Source and data traceability 62, Code-to-model traceability 58, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/ocellated_lizard_ca_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca.py at 8871db0, image/png, 32694 B, 1213×559 px, artifact_sha256 9450c57e57e5c19b0a6a3800debe9607df9072800a48b8d674f32efd06048a5b (sha256 9450c57e57e5c19b0a6a3800debe9607df9072800a48b8d674f32efd06048a5b), spec_fingerprint 242b9a7c86c1f9293dfbf14c7b4f7718e95fac3e748d9d6c90e4cc1c23174b29. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 242b9a7c86c1f9293dfbf14c7b4f7718e95fac3e748d9d6c90e4cc1c23174b29; artifact_sha256: 9450c57e57e5c19b0a6a3800debe9607df9072800a48b8d674f32efd06048a5b; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/ocellated_lizard_ca/ocellated_lizard_ca_reference.json=ed1472207d9c79bb..., datasets/ocellated_lizard_ca/scout_manifest.json=e5bca2d8766b49e7..., datasets/ocellated_lizard_ca/timon_lepidus_specimen.jpg=bc8e149849e6729d...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement formal negative and ablation controls: (1) insulated scale borders P = 0.0 (testing Lean Theorem 2 where zero border flux freezes juvenile noise), (2) homogeneous continuum skin P = 1.0 without scale border thinning (where smooth Turing waves cut across scale boundaries, degrading intra-scale uniformity), and (3) equal-diffusion control d = Dv/Du = 1.0 (abolishing Turing instability).",
        "remediation needed: Implement the continuous reaction-diffusion PDE on a 2D hexagonal skin-scale domain with spatially modulated scale-border diffusivity D_s(x) = P * D_s,interior at inter-scale borders (Manukyan et al. 2017 Fig. 4 & Methods Eqs. 1-8), demonstrating how P = 0.17 discretizes continuous Turing waves into monochromatic hexagonal scales whose neighbor histogram converges to the outer-totalistic CA.",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/ocellated_lizard_ca/ocellated_lizard_ca_reference.json`, `timon_lepidus_specimen.jpg`, `scout_manifest.json`, and `paper_citations.bib` at runtime; segment individual green and black dorsal scales from `timon_lepidus_specimen.jpg`; and compare biological Delaunay nearest-neighbor green/black degree distributions against both the scale-border PDE and the hexagonal CA.",
        "remediation needed: Sweep all 5 border thickness reduction regimes P in {0.0, 0.08, 0.17, 0.45, 1.0}, expose full CLI parameters (--P, --d, --rows, --cols, --steps, --seed), expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 8 reference-backed morphometric measurements, and upgrade `docs/media/ocellated_lizard_ca_comparison.png` (8 panels) and `docs/media/ocellated_lizard_ca_growth.gif`." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.67e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Manukyan et al. (2017) Nature hexagonal skin-scale border thickness reduction & outer-totalistic cellular automaton — Parameter expressivity: 44/100" ;
